  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add onion, garlic, and ginger; sauté until translucent, about 4 minutes.",
    "Stir in berbere spice and fennel; cook for another 2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add carrot, vegetable broth, and coconut milk; bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Gently place fish pieces into the pot, cover, and cook for 8 minutes until fish is opaque and flakes easily.",
    "Stir in toasted walnuts and pumpkin seeds, season with salt, pepper, and lemon juice, and simmer for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Remove from heat and transfer to serving bowls.",
    "Optionally, sprinkle extra toasted nuts on top for added crunch before serving."
  ],
